dsv41 patch 0091 (25.10.2026): upstream vLLM bug fixes backported onto 6e517b15 (in image v30).
#59096 file-tier mark_miss assert (EngineCore crash when a load fails while another request probes the same key);
#59880 spec-decode step blocks reserved in every KV cache group, not once (async loads, incl. 0084 rounds;
VLLM_DSV41_SPEC_RESERVE_PER_GROUP=0 restores the old count); #61174 stale block-table rows after a batch shrinks;
#63165 + #61000 shm_broadcast queue growth on the head node and buffer ownership; #59504 KV zeroing skipped only for the
groups an async load writes. Skipped #60767 (our SM120 sparse-SWA path reads only window slots, never whole pages).
Measured (A/B 25.10., same window, fresh boots): T=0 text identical 8/8 to v29; 1 / 4 / 8 streams 55.9 / 110.2 / 144.8
tok/s (v29 55.9 / 107.3 / 144.6), sustained 4x90 s 131.1 (130.0), 300K prefill 131 s (135 s), corruption 0 in 6 batteries.
